# base-system/profiles/desktop.list — Desktop graphical profile
# Inherits server profile and adds display server, window management, fonts, and terminals
#
# Every entry below names a package the source-built stages actually produce.
# base-system/README.md requires that optional services are not claimed as
# installed until they have a pinned ShreeOS package/build recipe, so a
# package that only exists in the Debian prototype prototype/ path is listed
# as a comment.

# Include server profile
@server

# Display Server & Graphics
xorg-server
xinit
mesa
libx11
libxft
libxinerama
# libinput — no pinned ShreeOS package/build recipe yet.

# Window Manager & GUI Utilities
dwm
st
dmenu

# Fonts & Theme
dejavu-fonts
shreeos-wallpapers
alsa-lib
alsa-utils
bluez
